---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Our Mission">
    

    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary to-primary text-white py-28 px-6 text-center overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
        <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-white/20 blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/4 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-emerald-300/20 blur-3xl"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6 relative z-10">
        <span class="text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest block">Bill of Senga</span>
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight">Our Mission</h1>
        <div class="w-16 h-0.5 bg-emerald-400/50 mx-auto"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Mission Statement -->
    <section class="py-20 px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <p class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-secondary leading-relaxed text-center italic mb-12">
          "My mission is to inspire a generation of farmers and communities to restore land, grow healthy food, and build lasting prosperity through sustainable agriculture."
        </p>
        <div class="w-12 h-px bg-primary/30 mx-auto mb-12"></div>
        <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed text-lg text-center">
          Even a small farm, built without a big budget, can become a place where knowledge grows, ideas are tested, and the future of sustainable farming is explored.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Looking Ahead -->
    <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-stone-50">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-10">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[28px]">visibility</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-secondary">Looking Ahead</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-stone-600 leading-relaxed text-lg pl-0 md:pl-16">
          <p>This farm in Senga is just the beginning.</p>
          <p>Over time, it can grow into a living ecosystem of ideas and practical solutions — a place where students, farmers, and communities learn from one another while applying these principles.</p>
          <p>Here, conservation, sustainable production, indigenous knowledge, and modern agricultural science come together to produce healthy food and natural products people can trust.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What We're Already Doing -->
    <section class="py-20 px-6">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <!-- Card 1 -->
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-stone-200/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-600 text-[24px]">restaurant</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-secondary mb-3">Sustainable Food</h3>
            <p class="text-stone-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
              Already, my family enjoys sustainably produced food from this farm, with some surplus to share with friends or sell at the market.
            </p>
          </div>
          <!-- Card 2 -->
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-stone-200/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-amber-600 text-[24px]">local_cafe</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-secondary mb-3">Sustainable Coffee</h3>
            <p class="text-stone-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
              I am also proud to produce and sell coffee grown through sustainable practices — a meaningful demonstration that environmentally responsible farming can also make economic sense.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Call to Action -->
    <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary to-primary text-white text-center">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-400 text-[48px]">volunteer_activism</span>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold">Join Us on This Journey</h2>
        <p class="text-stone-300 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Whether you are a farmer, a student, a researcher, or someone who cares about the future of our land — there is a place for you at BOS.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-4">
          <a href="/join_the_movement/" class="bg-white text-primary px-10 py-3.5 rounded-full font-semibold hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center inline-block">
            Support Our Mission
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  
    
</Layout>
